/obj/item/disk/holodisk/smorgasbord/coordinator
	name = "Coordinator's Briefing"
	desc = "A briefing for the Coordinator of the Smorgasbord."
	preset_image_type = /datum/preset_holoimage/engineer/ce
	preset_record_text = {"
	NAME Miskilamo Yard Director
	SAY Morning, Coordinator. I'm assuming you're aware of the gravity of the task before you.
	DELAY 25
	SAY Your ship carries delegates from several major groups in the Frontier.
	DELAY 15
	SAY Most of these groups hate each other's guts.
	DELAY 18
	SAY Each one, however, fulfills a mostly-different and unique role onboard.
	DELAY 15
	SAY Without the support of these groups, you will not be able to command the Smorgasbord safely.
	DELAY 25
	SAY First is the New Gorlex Republic.
	DELAY 10
	SAY Not the most-well-equipped of the groups, but one of the more vital ones.
	DELAY 20
	SAY Their delegation manages the engine bay, of which most was taken from a Kali-Andhi-class destroyer.
	DELAY 15
	SAY They also handle telecommunications, alongside life support and some combat duties.
	DELAY 20
	SAY How you deal with them is up to you.
	DELAY 15
	SAY Next are those filling a medical role. Makosso-Warra and Cybersun.
	DELAY 20
	SAY Warra brought more supplies, Cybersun brought fancier ones.
	DELAY 25
	SAY Cybersun also brought a Hardliner cell with them, while Warra just brought a VI watchman and some poor soul from N+S.
	DELAY 35
	SAY The Hardliners are primarily equipped for salvage and long-range combat, while the NGR is packing supplies for CQB.
	DELAY 25
	SAY Also on the topics of combat are the Pan-Gezenan Federation and Inteq.
	DELAY 25
	SAY The PGF are the largest combat force onboard, being from a major power's armed forces, but are the least bound to your orders.
	DELAY 30
	SAY Inteq, meanwhile, were directly hired by us so you still have some means of enforcement through force.
	DELAY 15
	SAY If their Master-at-Arms forgets this, feel free to remind them. You can use some of the cash in the budget to help with this.
	DELAY 25
	SAY There's also CLIP, who are present for emergency response and support. Similarly to Inteq, they aren't fully kitted for front-line work.
	DELAY 25
	SAY We also have some Frontiersman and Ramzi stowaways. They shouldn't cause too much trouble, but if they start getting violent, you should have no trouble rallying everyone else to deal with them.
	DELAY 35
	SAY That's everyone you have to deal with on this godforsaken mess. Good luck, Coordinator. I'll see you on the other side.

	"}
